  <item>
    <title>陈嘉映：哲学是什么？谈谈我所理解的哲学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682ef75cfcbc2e206b37bea6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682ef75cfcbc2e206b37bea6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 May 2025 10:08:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【完整讲座】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期为节选，</span><a href="https://wxaurl.cn/45q5Y4wtozf" data-url="https://wxaurl.cn/45q5Y4wtozf"><span>点击打开「爱智者城邦」小程序</span></a><span>获取</span><strong><span>完整版与逐字稿</span></strong><span>！更有数百场陈嘉映老师讲独家收录且均附文字稿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【讲座信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>学习哲学，是在学习一种“知识”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>哲学所关心的究竟是事物的“why”还是“how”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>哲学和科学的区别是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本讲座，陈老师将从以上问题入手谈谈他对哲学的理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲座时间：2010年9月21日</span></p><span></span><p><span>主讲人：陈嘉映（</span><strong><span>当代著名哲学学者，华东师范大学终身教授，首都师范大学特聘教授</span></strong><span>。著有《海德格尔哲学概论》《哲学·科学·常识》《说理》《简明语言哲学》《何为良好生活》《走出唯一真理观》《感知·理知·自我认知》等。）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 哲学是什么--汇通道理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> 哲学与知识相区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> 偶然与不偶然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3161">52:41</a>近代科学形成后，哲学和科学的分野</span></p><span></span><p><span>【责编】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小赵</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/661e71cb48c40e2fb0b62e2d/lmsAarfyJxhqM2A3dPbxX4xipmWc.m4a" length="56740861" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:28</itunes:duration>
